WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:07.130
Doodle Duel is Sketch and Guess turned into a team sport. Four to twelve players, blue against red.

2
00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:15.616
Teams take turns sending somebody to draw. That person picks one of three words and sketches it out, with no letters allowed.

3
00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:19.922
Here's the twist. Everybody can guess, on both teams.

4
00:00:20.072 --> 00:00:27.030
The faster the right answer comes in, the more points go to whoever guessed it, and the drawer's team gets points too.

5
00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:33.185
So when the other team is drawing, don't switch off. A lucky steal is worth just as much.

6
00:00:33.335 --> 00:00:38.949
Draw big, keep it simple, and when the rounds are over, the team with the higher total wins.
